n.aspx?Pname=b961f52b-40e3-4abb-b2ce-9ebf03c9883f.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Jamna Auto Industries Limited submitted an investor presentation regarding its proposed acquisition of Owen Springs Limited, a company incorporated in England and Wales. The transaction involves 100% ownership funded entirely from internal accruals with no external debt or shareholder dilution, featuring a purchase consideration of \u00a32.00M with \u00a3735K of current assets and no debt. Management highlighted that the acquisition serves as a ready-made platform in the UK leaf and parabolic spring aftermarket, supporting its Lakshya RISE 5000 growth ambition. Additionally, the company detailed Owen Springs' financial profile, operational footprint in Rotherham, and product capabilities. Jamna Auto Industries reported its strongest-ever annual and quarterly performance for FY26, driven by a broad-based recovery in M&HCV and LCV segments along with disciplined cost execution.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The acquisition is a step toward achieving 40% of turnover from new markets as part of the Lakshya RISE 5000 growth ambition.","quote":"A step toward 40% of turnover from new markets \u2014part of JAI\u2019s Lakshya RISE 5000 growth ambition.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3bbda71c-fdcd-4e3d-ad2a-f144542c90f0.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Performance was driven by a broad-based recovery across M&HCV and LCV segments.","quote":"This performance was driven by a broad-based recovery across the M&HCV and LCV segments, supported by disciplined cost execution and strong aftermarket momentum.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7fa2ee4b-f665-4859-9e9c-f20d30144455.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Jamna Auto Industries proposed the acquisition of Owen Springs Limited, a company incorporated in England and Wales.","quote":"Proposed Acquisition of Owen Springs Limited","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3bbda71c-fdcd-4e3d-ad2a-f144542c90f0.pdf"},{"claim":"The transaction involves 100% ownership funded entirely from JAI's internal accruals with no external debt and no shareholder dilution.","quote":"100% ownership, funded entirely from JAI\u2019s internal accruals \u2014no external debt, no shareholder dilution.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3bbda71c-fdcd-4e3d-ad2a-f144542c90f0.pdf"},{"claim":"New capacities were commissioned at Adityapur for parabolic springs and Indore for leaf spring and U-bolt.","quote":"Commissioned New Capacities :\u2013 Adityapur (Parabolic Spring) and Indore (Leaf Spring and U Bolt)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7fa2ee4b-f665-4859-9e9c-f20d30144455.pdf"},{"claim":"New integrated suspension and rubber projects are on track.","quote":"NewIntegratedsuspension&rubberprojectsareontrack.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=25f12b8f-2dc1-46f3-b87d-51ced9163d6f.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"FY26 performance was supported by disciplined cost execution.","quote":"This performance was driven by a broad-based recovery across the M&HCV and LCV segments, supported by disciplined cost execution and strong aftermarket momentum.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7fa2ee4b-f665-4859-9e9c-f20d30144455.pdf"},{"claim":"Revenue was reported at Rs. 668 Crores with EBITDA margins maintained at 17.5%.","quote":"\uf0d8 Revenue at Rs. 668 Crores with EBITDA margins maintained at 17.5%.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=25f12b8f-2dc1-46f3-b87d-51ced9163d6f.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Owen Springs has over 250 distributors, retailers, and garages with local warehousing and 350+ SKUs.","quote":"Over ~ 250 distributors, retailers and garages, with local warehousing.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3bbda71c-fdcd-4e3d-ad2a-f144542c90f0.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The acquisition is funded entirely from internal accruals with no external debt and no shareholder dilution.","quote":"100% ownership, funded entirely from JAI\u2019s internal accruals \u2014no external debt, no shareholder dilution.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3bbda71c-fdcd-4e3d-ad2a-f144542c90f0.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company targets an 18% reduction in decarbonization with H2FY2025 as the baseline by FY 2030.","quote":"I. Accelerating Decarbonization: Reduction of 18% (Baseline H2FY2025)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7fa2ee4b-f665-4859-9e9c-f20d30144455.pdf","timeframe":"FY 2030"},{"claim":"The company targets a 75% reduction in water stewardship and neutrality with FY2025 as the baseline by FY 2030.","quote":"III. Water Stewardship & Neutrality: Reduction of 75% (Baseline FY2025)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7fa2ee4b-f665-4859-9e9c-f20d30144455.pdf","timeframe":"FY 2030"},{"claim":"Management targets 100% reduction towards zero plastic by FY 2030.","quote":"V. Towards Zero Plastic: Reduction of 100%. (Baseline FY2025)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7fa2ee4b-f665-4859-9e9c-f20d30144455.pdf","timeframe":"FY 2030"},{"claim":"The c